: idle
:
: Test frames without a pending record change.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  rewrite report rewritten
  report 1 7 0 report report
  frame 1 7 100
  frame 2 7 200
  EOI
  idle
  idle
  EOO

: resent
:
: Test a resend triggered by a frame on another connection. Make sure the
: report is resent on its own connection.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  report 1 7 0 report report
  rewrite report rewritten
  change
  frame 2 7 100
  frame 2 7 200
  EOI
  signalled
  send 1 rewritten
  resent
  idle
  EOO

: pending
:
: Test a change signalled while another change is pending.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  change
  change
  EOI
  signalled
  pending
  EOO

: no-report
:
: Test a change that precedes the first report. Such a change is cleared
: since the first report is rewritten when it is sent.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  change
  frame 1 7 100
  report 1 7 200 report report
  frame 1 7 300
  EOI
  signalled
  no-report
  idle
  EOO

: other-thread
:
: Test a frame from another thread, which leaves the change pending until
: the report's thread sends a frame.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  report 1 7 0 report report
  rewrite report rewritten
  change
  frame 2 8 100
  frame 1 7 200
  EOI
  signalled
  other-thread
  send 1 rewritten
  resent
  EOO

: stale
:
: Test a report whose connection exceeded max_report_idle.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  report 1 7 0 report report
  rewrite report rewritten
  change
  frame 2 7 60001
  change
  frame 2 7 60002
  EOI
  signalled
  stale 60001
  signalled
  no-report
  EOO

: alive
:
: Make sure frames on the report's connection reset its idle time.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  report 1 7 0 report report
  frame 1 7 50000
  rewrite report rewritten
  change
  frame 2 7 100000
  EOI
  idle
  signalled
  send 1 rewritten
  resent
  EOO

: no-match
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  report 1 7 0 report report
  rewrite report -
  change
  frame 1 7 100
  EOI
  signalled
  no-match
  EOO

: unchanged
:
: Test a rewrite that equals the last sent frame.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  report 1 7 0 report rewritten
  rewrite report rewritten
  change
  frame 1 7 100
  EOI
  signalled
  unchanged
  EOO

: latest
:
: Make sure the most recent report is resent and the resent frame becomes
: the last sent frame.
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
  report 1 7 0 old old
  report 3 9 10 report report
  rewrite report rewritten
  change
  frame 1 9 100
  change
  frame 1 9 200
  EOI
  signalled
  send 3 rewritten
  resent
  signalled
  unchanged
  EOO
